I mean all the lines in the stan model that start with

target +=

Those lines are defining the model that stan samples from, and I believe that bridgesampling also uses those lines. But I think you want stan to only "see" the priors there, whereas you want bridgesampling to also evaluate the model likelihood.

Ed

